Hotel Management System – Comprehensive Software Requirements Document
Prepared by: BelTech Solutions
Project Type: Hotel, Restaurant, Bar & Hospitality Management System
Product Strategy: Customizable, reusable software product (SaaS-ready)
Core Modules: Stock Management, Order Management, Finance Management, Sales Management, Kitchen Management, and Business Intelligence Dashboard.
1. Project Overview
The proposed Hotel Management System is an integrated business management platform designed to digitize and automate hotel operations, including restaurant services, bar operations, cashier activities, kitchen workflows, inventory control, financial transactions, and business reporting.
The system will provide centralized control over all hotel operations while allowing different employees to access the system based on their assigned roles and responsibilities.
One of the most important objectives is to track every transaction by employee, understand how stock is consumed, manage customer orders, monitor bono-based transactions, and generate accurate financial and operational reports.
The system will be designed as a reusable product by BelTech Solutions, meaning it can later be configured and deployed for different hotels, restaurants, bars, lounges, and hospitality businesses.
Main objectives
Centralize hotel sales, inventory, orders, and financial operations.
Track sales and transactions by individual cashier, barman, and other employees.
Digitize the communication between cashiers and kitchen staff.
Manage bono issuance, redemption, and reconciliation.
Automatically deduct stock when products are sold or consumed.
Monitor revenue, expenses, profits, and outstanding balances.
Provide management with real-time dashboards and detailed reports.
Maintain accountability through user permissions and activity logs.
Support multiple sales points, bars, kitchens, and departments.
Provide an architecture that supports future expansion and resale.
